  "title": "2022 Advanced Elements AirVolution",
  "handle": "2022-advanced-elements-airvolution-1143",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Ask about deferred-interest financing programs!</p><div id=\"product-component-1651699749193\">&nbsp;</div><br /><strong>Ask about deferred-interest financing programs!</strong></p><p>Introducing a rigid high-pressure drop-stitch kayak unlike any other! The AirVolution is a streamlined high-performance kayak with paddling performance that rivals that of a hard-shell kayak. Featuring an open deck design for ease of entry, the AirVolution uses extremely durable materials and features many high-end components such as a high-back comfortable seat, bungee deck lacing for gear stowage, and heavy-duty grab handles. Simply unfold, inflate and youre ready for your next adventure!</p><p><strong>Specs:</strong><br /><strong>Length:</strong> 13'<br /><strong>Width:</strong> 33\"<br /><strong>Weight:</strong> 39lbs<br /><strong>Number of Paddlers:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Weight Capacity: </strong>300lbs<br /><strong>Packed Dimensions:</strong> 34\" x 19\" x 11\"<p>Backpack Roller Duffel\nSingle Action Hand Pump w/ Pressure Gauge\nAdjustable High-back Seat\nRemovable Tracking Fin\nRepair Kit\nOwners Manual\nHigh Performance Drop-stitch Construction\nPressure Relief Valves for proper inflation\nBungee deck lacing and d-rings for securing gear\nSoft Grip Carry Handles\nSupportive High-back Adjustable Seat\nDrain-well\nBelow Deck Storage Compartments for small items\nBackpack Roller Duffel for easy transport</p>",
